 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\n東京精密機器株式会社                                   MASTER SERVICES\n港区芝浦1-2-3, 530-0001 大阪市, Japan                           AGREEMENT\n登録番号: T9319092683765\n\n発行元                                                     請求先\n東京精密機器株式会社                                       株式会社山田製作所\n港区芝浦1-2-3                                             港区芝浦1-2-3\n530-0001 大阪市                                           104-0061 東京都\nJapan                                                     Japan\nVAT: T9319092683765\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 2026年03月26日 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween 東京精密機器株式会社, with its registered office at 港区芝浦1-2-3, 大阪市 (\"Party A\"), and 株式会社山田製作所, with its\nregistered office at 港区芝浦1-2-3, 東京都 (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\nParty A    東京精密機器株式会社 / 佐藤健一\nParty B    株式会社山田製作所 / 田中太郎\nDate       2026年03月26日",
